00:00:00,390 --> 00:00:03,690
(Transcribed by TurboScribe. Go Unlimited to remove this message.) SeaWorld is one of the most famous parks

2
00:00:03,690 --> 00:00:04,870
in the world.

3
00:00:05,930 --> 00:00:08,850
Thousands of people visit each year.

4
00:00:09,890 --> 00:00:12,070
Most of them go to see the dolphins

5
00:00:12,070 --> 00:00:14,390
and whales perform tricks.

6
00:00:15,450 --> 00:00:17,870
This is something they could never see in

7
00:00:17,870 --> 00:00:18,430
