10
00:00:23,550 --> 00:00:26,650
Thousands of people have been protesting the parks.

11
00:00:26,650 --> 00:00:30,910
These people say that dolphins and whales should

12
00:00:30,910 --> 00:00:33,590
not be forced to live in such small

13
00:00:33,590 --> 00:00:34,310
places.

14
00:00:35,150 --> 00:00:38,010
They should also never be forced to perform

15
00:00:38,010 --> 00:00:39,210
pointless tricks.

16
00:00:40,350 --> 00:00:43,490
Most people are starting to agree with this.

17
00:00:44,590 --> 00:00:48,010
SeaWorld will hopefully start listening to the protesters

18
00:00:48,010 --> 00:00:48,630
